WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,540
Since the arrangements for this large sum of money are very tight,

2
00:00:01,800 --> 00:00:02,820
It will start in three days

3
00:00:03,080 --> 00:00:06,640
Should we ask the Master to come to the Renshi Hall to sign up and go?

4
00:00:19,370 --> 00:00:20,370
Look at my brother’s complexion

5
00:00:20,630 --> 00:00:22,170
It seems that most of the injury has recovered

6
00:00:22,170 --> 00:00:23,710
This is all thanks to the Kozono brothers.

7
00:00:23,970 --> 00:00:27,810
Otherwise, I'm afraid I won't be able to catch up with this big sum of money and leave. Since it's such a coincidence,

8
00:00:28,070 --> 00:00:30,370
Let’s go register together. Next

9
00:00:35,540 --> 00:00:39,820
You are the Master Chu who fought against Hou San.

10
00:00:40,320 --> 00:00:41,600
I don’t know what my senior brother has to say.
